      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉状态不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc3c489fbe564c283c36ca13b76a88724cba6064f1b28aece2842e6a226a9f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:664238818f07a2b2f32d900e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！\r\n那么接下来怎么做呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ab01ebfc25361cbdf78f0dc15c04051a4159b6f9abdff4cf277d03b174772cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d562870b222fd7776bba3355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好ー，\r\n训练要加油了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d2ed876732b14672e2fd2db92f4e2b5d39f89bad561a4b74fac4e490c5cc27e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a289cd05deab6557d6f4529",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练清单怎么安排呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bbb2df7810dccf259c0f8c11179b1d626976d898f5eabdbc566f0008f5c5f01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9b4f6cb056d75eb27ab96c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯ー…\r\n感觉稍微有点使不上劲…",
      "source_fingerprint": "58fe1e5aa84896bff3c7a136dee51c206f23c3b8c3c5ec657d71161e6dabe17d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3afc8ddc9b89d19a40265041",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊…啊，对不起。\r\n稍微有点打不起精神…",
      "source_fingerprint": "95519d64061668be0f60924627e8f5aa713754700b9103383a24af3335082322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ee1537dcb22fc71746d9b70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜，身体使不上力气～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4c7876d763517062b06a78a14ff581b6442a1f671fc1b390bbc3f93c4b582b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db18b4e5ce3e874feebf8b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脑子里尽想着些不好的事情…\r\n哈啊～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "50fd57dbd7ab92d93f6b5dff1aaa59e6525ca3cbc6ec14360fa32905344f3d32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:889d5e071d643544533b8ede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次的比赛也要参加吗…？\r\n稍微感觉量有点太多了什么的…\r\n不不，我还是会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79b2a0baafdde8e0f256adf19b22ebe38f47919cd2ff746773fc2a195a62f085",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2cc8e75aedab9eb0f337c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那，那个～…能不参加这次的比赛，\r\n让我休息一下吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0247665d4364e3fd99589b572e9180a17e10f7af181fbcf3e94369c0b81cc39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fc9598164636d991cc5a567",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快一点快一点，我想快点开始比赛！\r\n现在的我可以尽情地发挥实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a9b0c8d0423f1f7a40e944ab2c46563f3a45dbb7282d42c39474fa29fdc6d78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1acdab413cdc45fb4ca43afd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态已调整到绝佳！\r\n剩下的就是在实战中赢下比赛了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f045f15d21a9bfa4951133383b0e142c6538faea57c5e023903e6577b7a5858",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:674e3129f3c3f9f46c655f8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向着日本第一的梦想，\r\n全力飞奔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af55c5585174cceeb370af6f3ee40ed3c7f8a5637220df453046916b604f07a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:963d2cea8da80655d8e99515",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，感觉不错！\r\n我会以达成目标为目的加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b22ee95cdb54b1d7dbb8bc78ca7bc7b9f332727a3465c7974c684b00f8aa986",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b22c77c1e27bc07c2ea634e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，身体感觉好轻快！\r\n能发挥出比平时更强的实力也说不定…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a73ee1d82c769a8e4b7e8a9cdd30040242c888141056bbd1c2c4fcb220a365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f0dbe99cd1c266486781950",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是重要的比赛，\r\n所以要好好加油了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f90f1b01cabb6872b897d43c1b057d7ee341220d917be1554ed4fa01f31fde5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af32988d43e83a7471496138",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于到了比赛的时候呢。\r\n我会以第1名为目标加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "291bee95a8f578ccb16ee6ce58ffb5c54cd11d5206b8ec1346a36f4da62141c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6129251daaa27b0e8b2230ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷静下来，为了能像往常一样\r\n发挥实力，\r\n我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade50846be2cc0f00e1430c3504d74237bddee9f2c7bfa06c6c99e08ce77ba87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb2b7c04010aa01b1b0edafe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开、开始紧张了…\r\n深呼吸、深呼吸…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef2d0276fc9cafbba6d9fe3b5901a23d46c6b721b60678b9855fc74d827a771b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c54ac4b2da96452fb03cdf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题的、没问题的…！\r\n总、总之我会\r\n尽情奔跑的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1167bec03c33ae1a9c537afe47dae8f74a14d1b4db54987b6cfa0f596a704b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2952a66adc5ac3d6862994e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉气势不足～…！\r\n能帮忙拍一下我的后背，给我鼓鼓劲吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c032d190cfed6456e899a31ac9fd0c430d023840cecbf21532edd587585ee57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29fdd35aa57546b477e080d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不能说泄气话呢。\r\n不努力的话…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "137c0574a9c05e9781960ac3ada1707861ef5bda2d6ecfd84e2a00363444ebaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e6880fe2bd8f439172ea81e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家看起来都好强的样子…\r\n但、但是我也会尽力而为的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b09d731225541976ea1040462bdb4ffd1d1a738b3f345189dd618051107a6d0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14057355ba99cdd3c14dacef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果能再努力调整一下状态就好了～。\r\n总、总之我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c65326b0963056af1df24698d74139af4b66cbe9811064ddcc01ad82f3d68b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e0d1eb7b026f776f0145253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能赢吗…\r\n呜呜、不能打退堂鼓…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f75360a3878ff410f7b11e18975191ef4e66f715b83dbd3dfe935a6ad6f208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:478f075290dca399ecfcb730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74943f67fdb6bec707ec5e6387cdfec8caec07d1c68c02caa8a577731d658a27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:247b1990120812b170fb1b87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37856990395c2e8d2f93741c5d35fcb43678531f679cbab98ac4667a82bdf516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:001bcdeef696cb4ba0a13681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3526ad293faaba2bbb60e92f2aa2f0ce80200789aaddb5c16e63e30f50a9723c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccc34ef3772cf869c0ad541b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中、集中…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14930f038192bd52f9b3d62b4ecb66d90442913969fb691141ac818b6de140b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd60becd40711247514c3dfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊嘞？",
      "source_fingerprint": "53393e71d4c30f397f5ff6e3d6599b5ea7167b3de4a75f785bbe3669c155704f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27fe6039ee42c4b8672f3964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c1006da88249698a22b67f1d9fc5da3573185c190621ec7839b42dc3f704242",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df2b4808f3159babe52828ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很期待～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12f2d6a4443e24d89a427855b93350f9248edf76d3376d57af4074a8054b0095",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "20046"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
